      "writtenOn": "2020-06-24T01:43:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added another method here to clean up stale role assignments: \n\n    def remove_stale_role_assignments(self):\n        role_ids \u003d [role[\u0027id\u0027] for role in PROVIDERS.role_api.list_roles()]\n        assignments \u003d self.list_role_assignments()\n        for assignment in self.list_role_assignments():\n            if assignment[\u0027role_id\u0027] not in role_ids:\n                PROVIDERS.assignment_api.delete_role_assignments(assignment[\u0027role_id\u0027])\n\n\nThis is only one possible solution, we can certainly look into other options.\n\nI invoked this from delete_role below by calling:\n\n  PROVIDERS.assignment_api.remove_stale_role_assignments()",
      "revId": "aad6021e4edfae5608a3b22f31276bb6b4d60b52",
